# This app needs NO credentials of its own.
#
# The preview used to be gated by SWAG/nginx HTTP basic auth, with
# BASIC_AUTH_USER/BASIC_AUTH_PASS here baked into
# /config/nginx/.htpasswd-ongehoord. Both are gone: the route now sits behind
# the single tinyauth door shared with every other protected surface, so there
# is one credential for the whole public surface instead of one per app.
# ADR-0034. `make check` asserts no per-app auth variable comes back.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# App runtime secrets do NOT belong here either. They live in
# ~/nas/.env.ongehoord and are injected into the container via the compose
# `env_file:` directive. The app (Nuxt) reads these NUXT_* vars at runtime:
#   NUXT_PUBLIC_TOKEN_GOOGLE_MAPS, NUXT_GOOGLE_MAPS_SECRET,
#   NUXT_PUBLIC_SCRIPTS_GOOGLE_ANALYTICS_ID, NUXT_HUB_PROJECT_KEY,
#   NUXT_VIMEO_CLIENT_IDENTIFIER, NUXT_VIMEO_ACCESS_TOKEN,
#   NUXT_VIMEO_CLIENT_SECRET, NUXT_MAILERSEND_API_KEY, NUXT_OPENAI_API_KEY
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
